<title>USA: Asia Pulp &amp; Paper at 14-5/8 in New York.</title>
<headline>Asia Pulp &amp; Paper at 14-5/8 in New York.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asian Pulp &amp; Paper closed at 14-5/8 in New York on Monday. It recorded the day's low of 13-3/4 and the day's high of 14-7/8.</p>
<p>Volume was 2.733,500 American Depository Shares. Block volume was 2,512,800. Its previous close on Friday was 13-3/4.</p>
<p>One ADS represents four common shares.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
